    "detailed_description": "<br><br>The HRUMKA crew was travelling through space on a yet another delivery mission. Passing by a bunch of asteroids, their ship suddenly plunged into one. Asteroids have no business having such a big gravity pull, yet here they are stuck on one that has its own atmosphere.  <br>Help the HRUMKA crew to repair their ship and investigate the strange place they landed on.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688520/extras/02e2cad9ab1846fc594810e7b8433a28.avif?t=1726725784\" width=600 height=84 /></span><br>The ship is equipped with clone printers. Unfortunately, only the green ink tank remained intact after the crash. Find ways to repair the remaining tanks. The clones can help you explore the area and retrieve equipment.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688520/extras/ea30bbf6ce3cd3b33c1387f014917b1d.poster.avif?t=1726725784\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688520/extras/ea30bbf6ce3cd3b33c1387f014917b1d.webm?t=1726725784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688520/extras/ea30bbf6ce3cd3b33c1387f014917b1d.mp4?t=1726725784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688520/extras/935024f78b2542d6d47a61024811bbc4.avif?t=1726725784\" width=600 height=84 /></span><br><br>Player and NPC share the same pool of abilities. This is both exciting and scary at the same time, because if you are not quick enough to collect the power gems, your enemies might become too strong to overcome.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688520/extras/47c66c1ca81819b0300c2dfe1b8c323f.poster.avif?t=1726725784\" width=600 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688520/extras/47c66c1ca81819b0300c2dfe1b8c323f.webm?t=1726725784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688520/extras/47c66c1ca81819b0300c2dfe1b8c323f.mp4?t=1726725784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688520/extras/726b191db8283a3b21d7a41a574c63ea.avif?t=1726725784\" width=600 height=88 /></span><br>Match 4 in a row to create a power up that can clear a whole column, Make a match in the shape of L or T to create a bomb. Once the cloning station gets fixed, you will be able to modify the power ups which clones can get.<br>Match 5 of a kind to open a door to a secret room.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688520/extras/e8b6c6c4e6f7e7d90f1a645856603762.poster.avif?t=1726725784\" width=348 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688520/extras/e8b6c6c4e6f7e7d90f1a645856603762.webm?t=1726725784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688520/extras/e8b6c6c4e6f7e7d90f1a645856603762.mp4?t=1726725784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688520/extras/061736923c1975f3b6fb99f9e7a1499a.avif?t=1726725784\" width=571 height=66 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Classic Match-3 gameplay with power ups and challenges<br></li><li>Roguelike elements like perma death, unlockable upgrades and abilities that greatly change the mode of play<br></li><li>Unlockable turn based game mode <i>(not in the demo)</i><br></li><li>Distinct biomes with different opportunities and hazzards <i>(not in the demo)</i></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<br><br>The HRUMKA crew was travelling through space on a yet another delivery mission. Passing by a bunch of asteroids, their ship suddenly plunged into one. Asteroids have no business having such a big gravity pull, yet here they are stuck on one that has its own atmosphere.  <br>Help the HRUMKA crew to repair their ship and investigate the strange place they landed on.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688520/extras/02e2cad9ab1846fc594810e7b8433a28.avif?t=1726725784\" width=600 height=84 /></span><br>The ship is equipped with clone printers. Unfortunately, only the green ink tank remained intact after the crash. Find ways to repair the remaining tanks. The clones can help you explore the area and retrieve equipment.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688520/extras/ea30bbf6ce3cd3b33c1387f014917b1d.poster.avif?t=1726725784\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688520/extras/ea30bbf6ce3cd3b33c1387f014917b1d.webm?t=1726725784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688520/extras/ea30bbf6ce3cd3b33c1387f014917b1d.mp4?t=1726725784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688520/extras/935024f78b2542d6d47a61024811bbc4.avif?t=1726725784\" width=600 height=84 /></span><br><br>Player and NPC share the same pool of abilities. This is both exciting and scary at the same time, because if you are not quick enough to collect the power gems, your enemies might become too strong to overcome.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinli